---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Services | Web Management, Strategy Consulting, Implementation & Training" description="Web management, strategy consulting, implementation, and training for businesses that have outgrown their website." ogImage="/og/services.png" ogImageAlt="Services: web management, strategy consulting, implementation, training.">
  <section class="broadsheet pt-ed-7 pb-ed-6">
    <p class="dateline reveal">
      <span>No. 03</span>
      <span class="dateline-divider"></span>
      <span>Services</span>
      <span class="dateline-divider"></span>
      <span>Month to month after onboarding</span>
    </p>
    <hr class="masthead-rule-thick reveal mt-ed-3" />

    <h1 class="display-h1 reveal mt-ed-5" data-vibe="default">
      Four things I do.<br /><em>Here's how each one works.</em>
    </h1>
    <div class="display-h1 reveal mt-ed-5" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" role="heading" aria-level="1" data-vibe="beach">
      Four ways I make your<br /><em>business visible.</em>
    </div>
    <div class="display-h1 reveal mt-ed-5" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" role="heading" aria-level="1" data-vibe="mountain">
      Four ways I strengthen<br /><em>what's under the hood.</em>
    </div>

    <hr class="masthead-rule-hair mt-ed-5" />

    <div class="editorial-grid mt-ed-5">
      <aside class="reveal pt-ed-2">
        <p class="byline">Scope note</p>
        <p class="byline mt-ed-1" style="color: var(--color-neutral-300); letter-spacing: 0.14em">
          Clear lanes
        </p>
      </aside>
      <div>
        <p class="lede reveal" data-frame="default">
          Web Management keeps the site healthy and reports what happened. Strategy Consulting gives you the outside read on what to do next. Implementation and Training are scoped one-time work when the answer is something built or something taught.
        </p>
        <p class="lede reveal" style="display:none" data-frame="sun">
          Keep the site stable. Get the strategy clear. Build only what needs building. Teach the team when capacity needs to live in-house. Four lanes, clean edges.
        </p>
        <p class="lede reveal" style="display:none" data-frame="moon">
          Web Management does not promise strategy. Strategy Consulting does not quietly become execution. Implementation starts with scope. Training starts with the skill gap. The edges matter.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="broadsheet pt-ed-6 pb-ed-6">
    <div class="editorial-grid">
      <aside class="section-marker reveal">
        <span class="section-marker__num">01</span>
        <span class="section-marker__label">The menu</span>
      </aside>

      <div>
        <h2 class="display-h2 reveal" data-vibe="default">
          I close the gap between the business you've built and the website representing it.
        </h2>
        <h2 class="display-h2 reveal" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" data-vibe="beach">
          I help businesses look as good online as they actually are.
        </h2>
        <h2 class="display-h2 reveal" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" data-vibe="mountain">
          I make sure the infrastructure under your business is as solid as the business itself.
        </h2>

        <ol class="service-ol reveal-stagger mt-ed-5">
          <li class="reveal" style="--i:0">
            <a href="/services/web-management">
              <span class="service-ol__num">01</span>
              <span class="service-ol__name">Web Management</span>
              <span class="service-ol__arrow" aria-hidden="true">-&gt;</span>
              <p class="service-ol__body">
                Your site moves to dedicated cloud hosting under my management. I handle updates, security, backups, monitoring, and the monthly report that proves the work got done.
              </p>
            </a>
          </li>

          <li class="reveal" style="--i:1">
            <a href="/services/marketing-strategy">
              <span class="service-ol__num">02</span>
              <span class="service-ol__name">Strategy Consulting</span>
              <span class="service-ol__arrow" aria-hidden="true">-&gt;</span>
              <p class="service-ol__body">
                Marketing-fluent advisory for visibility, positioning, search, operations, vendors, hiring, and growth decisions. I research, recommend, and help you decide. I do not quietly turn advice into execution.
              </p>
            </a>
          </li>

          <li class="reveal" style="--i:2">
            <a href="/services/implementation">
              <span class="service-ol__num">03</span>
              <span class="service-ol__name">Implementation</span>
              <span class="service-ol__arrow" aria-hidden="true">-&gt;</span>
              <p class="service-ol__body">
                Page builds, integrations, analytics setup, and scoped technical projects. The work starts with a written scope, ships with a handoff, and stays separate from advisory.
              </p>
            </a>
          </li>

          <li class="reveal" style="--i:3">
            <a href="/services/training">
              <span class="service-ol__num">04</span>
              <span class="service-ol__name">Training</span>
              <span class="service-ol__arrow" aria-hidden="true">-&gt;</span>
              <p class="service-ol__body">
                WordPress, SEO, AI workflow, and team-capacity sessions built around real assignments, not webinars. Your team learns by doing the work on its own systems.
              </p>
            </a>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="broadsheet pt-ed-6 pb-ed-6">
    <div class="editorial-grid">
      <aside class="section-marker reveal">
        <span class="section-marker__num">02</span>
        <span class="section-marker__label">How it starts</span>
      </aside>

      <div>
        <h2 class="display-h2 reveal">No mystery, no theater.</h2>
        <ol class="service-ol mt-ed-5 reveal-stagger">
          <li class="reveal" style="--i:0">
            <div class="grid gap-ed-2 py-ed-4" style="grid-template-columns: 4.5rem 1fr">
              <span class="service-ol__num" style="grid-column:1">01</span>
              <div style="grid-column:2">
                <h3 class="font-display text-2xl text-neutral-100">You tell me what's going on.</h3>
                <p class="body-news mt-ed-2">I don't need a polished brief. I need the version you'd tell a friend.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="reveal" style="--i:1">
            <div class="grid gap-ed-2 py-ed-4" style="grid-template-columns: 4.5rem 1fr">
              <span class="service-ol__num" style="grid-column:1">02</span>
              <div style="grid-column:2">
                <h3 class="font-display text-2xl text-neutral-100">We name the right shape.</h3>
                <p class="body-news mt-ed-2">Sometimes that is a retainer. Sometimes it is a scoped project. Sometimes it is neither, and I say that early.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="reveal" style="--i:2">
            <div class="grid gap-ed-2 py-ed-4" style="grid-template-columns: 4.5rem 1fr">
              <span class="service-ol__num" style="grid-column:1">03</span>
              <div style="grid-column:2">
                <h3 class="font-display text-2xl text-neutral-100">You get a clear next step.</h3>
                <p class="body-news mt-ed-2">Scope, quote, timeline, or a better direction. Nobody's time gets wasted pretending.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="broadsheet pt-ed-6 pb-ed-8">
    <hr class="masthead-rule" />
    <div class="editorial-grid mt-ed-6">
      <aside class="reveal">
        <p class="byline">Closing notice</p>
      </aside>
      <div>
        <h2 class="display-h2 reveal">Not sure where to start<span data-personalize="name-comma" style="display:none"></span>?</h2>
        <p class="lede mt-ed-3 reveal" data-frame="default">
          Tell me what's going on and I'll tell you which of these makes sense. Sometimes the answer is "none of them, here's what you actually need."
        </p>
        <p class="lede mt-ed-3 reveal" style="display:none" data-frame="sun">
          Tell me where you're headed and I'll tell you which of these gets you there fastest. Sometimes the answer is "none of them, here's what you actually need."
        </p>
        <p class="lede mt-ed-3 reveal" style="display:none" data-frame="moon">
          Tell me what's not working and I'll tell you which of these fixes it. Sometimes the answer is "none of them, here's what you actually need."
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="cta-stamp reveal mt-ed-5">
          Start a conversation
          <span aria-hidden="true">-&gt;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
